    "preferred_description_beginner": "Plant zucchini in rich, well-drained soil. Mix a few inches of compost into the bed before you plant, and use raised beds or low mounds if your soil is heavy or stays wet. Good drainage plus plenty of compost gives you healthy, productive plants.",
